WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
Kill one and make him familiar

2
00:00:02,530 --> 00:00:04,610
I won't give up just because of a word

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:13,000
It's okay. It's great.

4
00:00:17,870 --> 00:00:20,310
I'll die letting him protect you

5
00:00:21,360 --> 00:00:23,400
Calling him a bad guy made him cry

6
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:27,000
Let me figure out where I am from here.

7
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,360
Just kidding you

8
00:00:28,640 --> 00:00:40,890
Your bad guy is alive and well, the real escort girl

9
00:00:41,050 --> 00:00:42,890
Please punish me if my men arrive late.

10
00:00:43,170 --> 00:00:45,250
Only after killing did he think of his master

11
00:00:45,730 --> 00:00:50,460
This armor is full of rubbish. Come on.

12
00:00:51,060 --> 00:00:54,910
Pack your things first, then return to the imperial capital and collect the third lady.

13
00:00:55,270 --> 00:01:01,430
What should I do with the captured assassins? Kill them all and kneel down. Do you hear me?

14
00:01:01,710 --> 00:01:03,350
The third lady asks you to kneel down

15
00:01:06,970 --> 00:01:08,290
I want you to kneel down
